name pdftoolbox
category Package
revision 74832
shortdesc A plain-pdfTeX toolbox for creating beautiful documents
longdesc pdfToolbox is a toolbox of various "subpackages" intended for
longdesc programming and creating beautiful plain-pdfTeX documents. It
longdesc is an amalgamation of the following "subpackages" (in the
longdesc future there will be an ability to access each one by itself):
longdesc pdfData -- for storing and manipulating data; pdfDstruct -- for
longdesc managing the layout and structure of your document; pdfGraphics
longdesc -- for adding some color and illustrations to your document.
longdesc pdfToolbox currently only works with pdfTeX. It is not
longdesc compatible with any form of LaTeX, and currently does not work
longdesc with XeTeX or LuaTeX (though hopefully LuaTeX support will be
longdesc added in the future).
